    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-2C65F33937910ABA-Q1">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>другу</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 상호대명사 друг друга
정답은 ②이다. 상호대명사 друг друга에서 뒤의 друг는 동사의 지배에 따라 격이 바뀐다. помогать는 여격을 요구하므로 друг другу가 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>друга</choice_text>
          <commentary>대격·생격 형태이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>другу</choice_text>
          <commentary>여격이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>с другом</choice_text>
          <commentary>조격 형태이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>о друге</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치격 형태이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-2C65F33937910ABA-Q2">
      <question_stem>각 문장의 밑줄 친 두 단어가 반의어가 아닌 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>문장</keyword>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>단어</keyword>
        <keyword>반의어</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>У Лены &lt;u&gt;длинные&lt;/u&gt; волосы, а у Наташи &lt;u&gt;прямые&lt;/u&gt; волосы.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 반의어
정답은 ②이다. далеко-близко, маленький-большой, хорошо-плохо는 반의어이다. длинный(긴)의 반의어는 короткий(짧은)이고, прямой(곧은)의 반의어는 кудрявый(곱슬곱슬한)이므로 длинные와 прямые는 반의어가 아니다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Мой дом &lt;u&gt;далеко&lt;/u&gt; отсюда, а дом моего друга &lt;u&gt;близко&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>반의어이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>У Лены &lt;u&gt;длинные&lt;/u&gt; волосы, а у Наташи &lt;u&gt;прямые&lt;/u&gt; волосы.</choice_text>
          <commentary>반의어가 아니므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Это &lt;u&gt;маленький&lt;/u&gt; стол, а там &lt;u&gt;большой&lt;/u&gt; стол.</choice_text>
          <commentary>반의어이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Коля &lt;u&gt;хорошо&lt;/u&gt; говорит по-корейски, а Саша &lt;u&gt;плохо&lt;/u&gt;.</choice_text>
          <commentary>반의어이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-2C65F33937910ABA-Q3">
